      "title": "Bilateral Settlement Rules & Invariant Guarantees",
      "items": [
        "Pre-Funded Reciprocal Buffers: Aura Bank hosts ACC-SETTLEMENT-COOBS and CooBS hosts ACC-SETTLEMENT-AURABANK (each seeded with a 5,000,000 PHP settlement buffer).",
        "Symmetric API Contract: Both institutions expose the identical endpoint: POST /api/v1/interbank/transfers/inbound with the same JSON request and response payloads.",
